{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107227","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107227/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107227/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107227/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107227","id":3125739965,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6ZcYGR","number":107227,"title":"GDScript: Add Trait System","user":{"login":"SeremTitus","id":58259212,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4MjU5MjEy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58259212?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeremTitus","html_url":"https://github.com/SeremTitus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeremTitus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeremTitus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeremTitus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeremTitus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeremTitus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeremTitus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeremTitus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeremTitus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeremTitus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330068,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/feature%20proposal","name":"feature proposal","color":"4466ff","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":83,"created_at":"2025-06-06T19:56:02Z","updated_at":"2026-07-16T21:36:20Z","closed_at":"2026-07-08T09:48:18Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107227","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107227","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107227.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107227.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"* Supersedes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/97657.\r\n* Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/6416.\r\n\r\nFocusing on:\r\n- Traits are declared as members of a class.\r\n- Trait hold all members that a class can except for inner classes.\r\n- Method Overriding: Allowing classes to override methods defined in traits.\r\n- Enforcing the implementation of bodyless methods in classes that are from traits.\r\n- The 'uses' keyword is maintained as its short and clear, however, find a poll below.\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\n# Keeps code DRY (Don't Repeat Yourself)\r\nclass_name Player extends Node\r\nuses Damageable, Movable\r\n\r\nfunc _ready():\r\n\tdied.connect(on_death)\r\n\tprint(\"Player spawned with health:\", health, \"and speed:\", speed)\r\n\t# Using Movable trait\r\n\tmove(Vector2.RIGHT)\r\n\t# Using Damageable trait\r\n\ttake_damage(50)\r\n\tprint(\"Is player dead?\", is_dead())\r\n\ttake_damage(60)  # Triggers death\r\n\r\nfunc on_death():\r\n\tprint(\"Player has died.\")\r\n\t\r\ntrait Damageable:\r\n\tsignal died\r\n\r\n\tconst MAX_HEALTH := 100\r\n\tvar health: int = MAX_HEALTH\r\n\r\n\tfunc take_damage(amount: int) -> void:\r\n\t\thealth -= amount\r\n\t\tprint(\"Took damage:\", amount, \"Health now:\", health)\r\n\t\tif health <= 0:\r\n\t\t\tdied.emit()\r\n\r\n\tfunc is_dead() -> bool:\r\n\t\treturn health <= 0\r\n\r\n\tfunc on_death()  # Unimplemented method – must be overridden\r\n\r\ntrait Movable:\r\n\t@export var speed: float = 100.0\r\n\r\n\tfunc move(direction: Vector2) -> void:\r\n\t\tprint(\"Moving in direction:\", direction.normalized() * speed)\r\n```","closed_by":{"login":"SeremTitus","id":58259212,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4MjU5MjEy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58259212?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeremTitus","html_url":"https://github.com/SeremTitus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeremTitus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeremTitus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeremTitus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeremTitus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeremTitus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeremTitus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeremTitus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeremTitus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeremTitus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107227/reactions","total_count":513,"+1":248,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":116,"confused":0,"heart":65,"rocket":13,"eyes":71},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107227/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}